      "end": "01:25.259",
      "words": [
        "01:23.974",
        "01:24.069",
        "01:24.201",
        "01:24.610",
        "01:24.733",
        "01:24.915"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no salvation for the sons of man.",
