      "words": [
        "01:25.342",
        "01:25.511",
        "01:25.680",
        "01:26.074",
        "01:26.160",
        "01:26.262",
        "01:26.425",
        "01:26.595"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The skies will tremble and the earth will quake,",
